Subject: Is it possible to color tip points and OTUS with different colors?
Message-ID: <klJSLZ_LyM8.h7nMBaorDQAJ@bioc-ggtree.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/bioc-ggtree/c/klJSLZ_LyM8/m/h7nMBaorDQAJ>
