> installation path not writeable, unable to update packages: Matrix, mgcv, nlme, survival

You don’t have permission to write to the R installation path, so that you can’t update packages that come with R.

But you have permission to install R packages to a libPath that you have write permission.

You can check out library path by:
.libPaths()

